# Checkbox questions

<Directive id="use-the-checkboxes">When several options can apply together, ask through the checkbox list described here. Do not ask about them one by one, and do not write them in a normal reply.</Directive>

<AskMany id="how-to-ask" title="How to ask" />

## Example

For "Which checks should I run before the release?", offer `Unit tests`, `Lint`, `Security scan` and `Load test`, each with one line saying what it covers.
